flowchart LR
 U[User] --> G[Input policy and authentication]
 G --> APP[AI application]
 APP --> RET[Retriever]
 DOC[Untrusted documents] --> RET
 RET --> B[Source trust and content boundary]
 B --> LLM[LLM]
 LLM --> T{Tool call?}
 T -->|Yes| AUTH[Independent tool authorization]
 AUTH --> AUD[Audit and execution]
 T -->|No| OUT[Output validation]
 AUD --> OUT
